<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Dear {{lead.First Name:default= }},</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">International admissions is at a tipping point. A surge in applications, higher enrolment targets, and tighter compliance requirements are colliding with operational systems and staffing models that haven’t kept pace.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Admissions and recruitment teams are under pressure to deliver more, faster – but many feel they are being asked to meet strategic goals without strategic investment.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />That’s why Flywire, Tribal and Edified have co-designed the <strong>Admissions Navigator</strong>, a new research initiative that helps universities assess their international admissions capabilities against a future-focused framework.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Co-created with 18 UK universities, the <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://app.edified.co.uk/admissions-navigator?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Admissions Navigator</u></strong></span></a> offers a fast, practical way to understand your strengths, uncover gaps and spark strategic conversations about what’s needed to deliver on recruitment targets.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 26px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">How does it work?</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>1. Complete the free self-assessment survey</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>All UK universities are invited to participate in the Admissions Navigator research.</li> 
<li>The <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://app.edified.co.uk/admissions-navigator?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>self-assessment survey</u></strong></span></a> should initially be completed by the Head of Admissions and Head of International Recruitment (or equivalent).</li> 
<li>It will take approximately 15 minutes to answer the questions.</li> 
<li>The deadline for submission is <strong>Monday 11 August 2025.</strong></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>2. Get your personal scorecard</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Upon completion of the self-assessment, each person will receive an individual scorecard showing how their responses align with sector-defined capabilities.</li> 
<li>The scorecard will indicate strengths and gaps in eight future-focused areas.</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>3. Invite your colleagues to participate</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Share the survey with senior colleagues in Admissions, International Recruitment, IT, Planning, Finance and Compliance and invite them to complete the self-assessment too.</li> 
<li>The deadline for submission is <strong>Friday 5 September 2025</strong>.</li> 
<li>The more perspectives, the richer your insights – and you’ll unlock a tailored capability report for your university.</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>4. Get a tailored capability report with recommendations</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>If multiple stakeholders from your university complete the survey, you’ll also receive a detailed report with consolidated insights and practical recommendations for improvement.</li> 
<li>The capability report will be shared with the Heads of Admissions and International Recruitment (or equivalent), who can then disseminate further within their institution.</li> 
<li>Data will be aggregated so that individuals cannot be identified.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
