<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Your data is handled with care</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><br /></strong>The Admissions Navigator research is being administered by Edified, a specialist education consultancy with global experience in research and benchmarking.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">All responses are collected via a secure online platform and managed in line with <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.edified.com.au/privacy-policy?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Edified's privacy policy</u></strong></span></a>. Institution-specific responses will remain confidential and will not be reported publicly.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Sector-wide insights will be anonymised and aggregated into a summary report, to be shared at the Flywire International Insights Summit in November 2025.<strong><br /></strong></p> </td> 
</tr> 
